    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After inheriting your late aunt\u2019s mansion, you arrive in the bubbly town of Cleanland. Unfortunately, your not-so-humble abode is infested with germs! Armed with a broom and a freshly printed degree in janitorial arts, it\u2019s your job as the Town Janitor to fight them off. But wait, who is this small, floating man in your house? Sent on a special assignment from the positive powers that be, Beau needs your help!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the vibrant residents of Cleanland, clean up the town, and uncover the mystery within your aunt's mansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Key Features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Swapping Combat with 10 playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Janitor Jobs to fight germs around Cleanland.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of NPCs to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open town to explore.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central narrative revolving around your recently inherited mansion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 character routes to explore the lives  of Cleanland's inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of items to use in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Demo<strong>\u00a0</strong>Key Features:</u>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character swapping combat with 3 playable characters.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Janitor Jobs to fight germs around Cleanland.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 NPCs to interact with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open town to explore.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of items to use in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acted combat!</p></li></ul>",
